A quoted item run measures its written brace

```
> -{.a} {.x
         .y}
plain
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li class="a">{.x
.y}
plain</li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
```

```
> > - {.x
       .y}
plain
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote>
    <ul>
      <li>{.x
.y}
plain</li>
    </ul>
  </blockquote>
</blockquote>
```

```
>  - {.x
     .y}
plain
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>{.x
.y}
plain</li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
```

```
> > - {.x
> >    .y}
plain
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote>
    <ul>
      <li></li>
    </ul>
  </blockquote>
</blockquote>
<p>plain</p>
```
